### Dsl for WorkFLow Building
build a python library to enable user to build agent workflow by themself.
if python is not enough, we could build a new language.

## outline
prompt file:config of Stage
Stage:a stage of prompting with its scope to control context and prompt
Skill:user created workflow could be a skill to use.
Workflow:main program.A cobination with programming language and "Skill and Stage"
Workflow<-->Skill

